  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcPlanner .NET: the Scheduler (day, week, work week, month and agenda), Gantt and Kanban views over one shared task list in WinForms, WPF and Avalonia, with drag, summaries, milestones, progress, grouping by resource, DataTable and JSON data and headless PNG and SVG output. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Recurrence, dependencies with auto-scheduling, the critical path, baselines, the Resource Timeline view, Kanban swimlanes and WIP limits, and iCalendar and MS Project XML (MSPDI) import and export are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
